       "description": "Store what was learned once something non-obvious works or a quirk costs time: the approach, the gotcha, the design reason, or a recipe. Terse. A recipe is a stored call {tool, args} whose string values may hold {{slot}} placeholders named in `slots`. `refs` are handles of outputs or branches that show it. `supersedes` replaces an earlier id.",
